---
import { APLD_CURRENT_PRICE, APLD_PRICE_DATE, apldReported } from '../../data/apld-valuation';
interface Props { language?: 'ko' | 'en' }
const { language = 'ko' } = Astro.props;
const ko = language === 'ko';
---

<section class="apld-lab" data-apld-lab data-language={language} data-price={APLD_CURRENT_PRICE} aria-labelledby={`apld-lab-title-${language}`}>
  <header>
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">THE ARCHIVE / VALUATION LAB</p>
      <h3 id={`apld-lab-title-${language}`}>Applied Digital Corporation Valuation Lab</h3>
      <p>{ko ? '계약된 1.41GW가 모든 자본청구권을 거친 뒤 보통주에 얼마나 남는지, 가정의 조합으로 점검합니다.' : 'Stress-test what may remain for common shareholders after 1.41GW of contracted capacity clears construction and capital claims.'}</p>
    </div>
    <span class="badge">EQUITY BRIDGE · SENSITIVITY</span>
  </header>

  <div class="toolbar" role="group" aria-label={ko ? '시나리오 프리셋' : 'Scenario presets'}>
    <span>{ko ? '프리셋' : 'Presets'}</span><button type="button" data-preset="bear">Bear</button><button type="button" data-preset="base" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Base</button><button type="button" data-preset="bull">Bull</button><button type="button" data-reset>{ko ? '초기화' : 'Reset'}</button><button type="button" data-share>{ko ? '설정 링크 복사' : 'Copy settings link'}</button>
  </div>

  <div class="results" aria-live="polite">
    <div><span>{ko ? 'Bear 예비 가치' : 'Bear preliminary value'}</span><strong>$0.00</strong><small>{ko ? '공시 가정의 하단' : 'Lower disclosed-case proxy'}</small></div>
    <div class="primary"><span>{ko ? 'Base 예비 가치' : 'Base preliminary value'}</span><strong>$5.02</strong><small>{ko ? '계약 자산 기준' : 'Contracted-assets basis'}</small></div>
    <div><span>{ko ? 'Bull 예비 가치' : 'Bull preliminary value'}</span><strong>$26.18</strong><small>{ko ? '더 강한 실행 가정' : 'Stronger execution case'}</small></div>
    <div><span>{ko ? '기준 시장가격' : 'Reference market price'}</span><strong>${APLD_CURRENT_PRICE}</strong><small>{APLD_PRICE_DATE}</small></div>
  </div>

  <section class="reverse" aria-live="polite">
    <div><span>REVERSE VALUATION</span><h4>{ko ? '현재가를 설명하려면 무엇이 더 필요한가?' : 'What else must be true to support the market price?'}</h4><p data-out="reverse">{ko ? 'Base case와 시장가격의 간격은 더 낮은 CAPEX·더 싼 자본·더 강한 재임대·추가 양(+) NPV MW의 조합을 요구한다.' : 'The gap between the Base case and market price requires a combination of lower CAPEX, cheaper capital, stronger re-letting, or additional positive-NPV MW.'}</p></div>
    <strong data-out="signal">{ko ? '추가 NAV 필요' : 'Additional NAV required'}</strong>
  </section>

  <div class="mode-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label={ko ? '모델 모드' : 'Model mode'}><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-tab="simple">Simple</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="advanced">Advanced / Reverse</button></div>

  <div class="workbench">
    <section class="controls" aria-labelledby={`apld-assumptions-${language}`}>
      <div class="section-heading"><span>01 / ASSUMPTIONS</span><h4 id={`apld-assumptions-${language}`}>{ko ? '가정 바꾸기' : 'Change assumptions'}</h4></div>
      <div class="control-grid">
        <label><span>{ko ? 'NOI 마진' : 'NOI margin'} <output data-value="noi">86%</output></span><input name="noi" type="range" min="70" max="95" step="1" value="86" /></label>
        <label><span>{ko ? 'MW당 잔여 CAPEX' : 'Residual CAPEX / MW'} <output data-value="capex">$12M</output></span><input name="capex" type="range" min="8" max="16" step=".5" value="12" /></label>
        <label><span>{ko ? '할인율' : 'Discount rate'} <output data-value="discount">8.5%</output></span><input name="discount" type="range" min="6" max="14" step=".5" value="8.5" /></label>
        <label><span>{ko ? '재임대 NOI 유지율' : 'Reletting NOI retention'} <output data-value="reletting">85%</output></span><input name="reletting" type="range" min="40" max="110" step="5" value="85" /></label>
      </div>
      <div class="control-grid advanced-controls" data-advanced hidden><label><span>{ko ? '추가 계약 MW' : 'Additional contracted MW'} <output data-value="mw">0 MW</output></span><input name="mw" type="range" min="0" max="1000" step="25" value="0" /></label></div>
      <p class="validation">{ko ? '슬라이더는 공시 사실이 아닌 민감도 가정입니다. 회사 가이던스나 가격목표가 아닙니다.' : 'Sliders are sensitivity assumptions, not company guidance or price targets.'}</p>
    </section>
    <section class="bridge" aria-labelledby={`apld-bridge-${language}`}>
      <div class="section-heading"><span>02 / EQUITY BRIDGE</span><h4 id={`apld-bridge-${language}`}>{ko ? '계약에서 보통주까지' : 'From contracts to common equity'}</h4></div>
      <dl><div><dt>{ko ? '최소 계약 임대료' : 'Contracted minimum rent'}</dt><dd>$35.73B</dd></div><div><dt>{ko ? '기본 임대료 (Q1)' : 'Base rent (Q1)'}</dt><dd>$65.8M</dd></div><div><dt>{ko ? 'HPC NOI (Q1)' : 'HPC NOI (Q1)'}</dt><dd>$58.8M</dd></div><div><dt>{ko ? '잔여 건설·자본청구권' : 'Construction and capital claims'}</dt><dd>{ko ? '프로젝트별 재검증 필요' : 'Requires project-level verification'}</dd></div><div class="total"><dt>{ko ? '현재 입력의 신호' : 'Signal at current inputs'}</dt><dd data-out="bridgeSignal">{ko ? '시장가격보다 낮은 경제성' : 'Economics remain below market'}</dd></div></dl>
      <p>{ko ? '계약 규모와 보통주 가치는 같은 숫자가 아니다. CAPEX와 자본 제공자 청구권을 모두 지불한 뒤의 잔여가치만 보통주에 귀속된다.' : 'Contract scale is not common-equity value. Only the residual after CAPEX and all capital-provider claims belongs to common shareholders.'}</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="sensitivity"><div class="section-heading"><span>03 / SENSITIVITY MAP</span><h4>{ko ? '시장가격과의 간격을 만드는 변수' : 'Variables that close—or widen—the market gap'}</h4></div><div class="sensitivity-bars" data-sensitivity></div></section>
  <p class="model-note">{ko ? `교육용 시나리오 도구 · 투자 권유가 아니다. 출처: Applied Digital FY2027 Q1 10-Q·실적자료. 기본 임대료 ${apldReported.baseRent}M과 구축서비스 ${apldReported.tenantBuildServices}M는 의도적으로 분리한다. 프로젝트별 CAPEX와 현금분배가 완전히 공개되지 않아, 결과는 가격목표가 아니라 Equity Bridge의 민감도 신호다.` : `Educational scenario tool, not investment advice. Sources: Applied Digital FY2027 Q1 10-Q and earnings materials. Base rent (${apldReported.baseRent}M) and tenant build services (${apldReported.tenantBuildServices}M) are deliberately separated. Because project CAPEX and cash distributions are not fully public, output is an Equity Bridge sensitivity signal—not a price target.`}</p>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-apld-lab]').forEach((root) => {
    const ko = root.dataset.language !== 'en';
    const presets = { bear: { noi: 80, capex: 13, discount: 11, reletting: 55, mw: 0 }, base: { noi: 86, capex: 12, discount: 8.5, reletting: 85, mw: 0 }, bull: { noi: 89, capex: 11, discount: 7, reletting: 100, mw: 200 } } as const;
    let advanced = false;
    const input = (name: string) => root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`[name="${name}"]`)!;
    const number = (name: string) => Number(input(name).value);
    const write = (name: string, value: string) => { const node = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-out="${name}"]`); if (node) node.textContent = value; };
    const setUrl = () => { const url = new URL(window.location.href); url.searchParams.set('apldmode', advanced ? 'advanced' : 'simple'); ['noi', 'capex', 'discount', 'reletting', 'mw'].forEach((name) => url.searchParams.set(`apld_${name}`, input(name).value)); history.replaceState(null, '', url); };
    const render = () => {
      const noi = number('noi'); const capex = number('capex'); const discount = number('discount'); const reletting = number('reletting'); const mw = number('mw');
      const values: Record<string, string> = { noi: `${noi}%`, capex: `$${capex.toFixed(capex % 1 ? 1 : 0)}M`, discount: `${discount.toFixed(1)}%`, reletting: `${reletting}%`, mw: `${mw.toLocaleString()} MW` };
      Object.entries(values).forEach(([name, value]) => { const node = root.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>(`[data-value="${name}"]`); if (node) node.value = value; });
      const score = (noi - 86) * .5 + (12 - capex) * 1.25 + (8.5 - discount) * 1.5 + (reletting - 85) * .08 + mw * .008;
      const signal = score >= 4 ? (ko ? '간격 축소' : 'Gap narrowing') : score >= 0 ? (ko ? '추가 NAV 필요' : 'Additional NAV required') : (ko ? '시장가격보다 낮은 경제성' : 'Economics below market');
      write('signal', signal); write('bridgeSignal', signal);
      write('reverse', score >= 4 ? (ko ? '현재 조합은 시장가격과의 간격을 일부 줄인다. 다만 프로젝트별 CAPEX와 자본청구권을 확인하기 전에는 가격목표로 읽을 수 없다.' : 'These inputs begin to narrow the market gap. It remains a sensitivity signal, not a price target, until project CAPEX and capital claims are verified.') : (ko ? '현재가를 설명하려면 더 낮은 CAPEX·더 싼 자본·더 강한 재임대·추가 양(+) NPV MW가 더 필요하다.' : 'Supporting the market price still requires lower CAPEX, cheaper capital, stronger re-letting, or additional positive-NPV MW.'));
      const bars: Array<[string, number]> = [[ko ? 'NOI 마진' : 'NOI margin', Math.max(8, Math.min(100, 50 + (noi - 86) * 7))], [ko ? '잔여 CAPEX' : 'Residual CAPEX', Math.max(8, Math.min(100, 50 + (12 - capex) * 15))], [ko ? '할인율' : 'Discount rate', Math.max(8, Math.min(100, 50 + (8.5 - discount) * 12))], [ko ? '재임대' : 'Re-letting', Math.max(8, Math.min(100, 50 + (reletting - 85) * 1.2))], [ko ? '추가 MW' : 'Additional MW', Math.max(8, Math.min(100, 20 + mw / 12))]];
      const holder = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-sensitivity]')!; holder.replaceChildren(...bars.map(([name, width]) => { const row = document.createElement('div'); const label = document.createElement('span'); const meter = document.createElement('i'); const value = document.createElement('b'); label.textContent = String(name); meter.style.setProperty('--w', `${width}%`); value.textContent = `${Math.round(width)}%`; row.append(label, meter, value); return row; })); setUrl();
    };
    const setPreset = (preset: keyof typeof presets) => { Object.entries(presets[preset]).forEach(([name, value]) => input(name).value = String(value)); root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-preset]').forEach((button) => { const active = button.dataset.preset === preset; button.classList.toggle('active', active); button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active)); }); advanced = preset === 'bull'; root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-advanced]').forEach((node) => node.hidden = !advanced); root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-tab]').forEach((button) => button.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(button.dataset.tab === (advanced ? 'advanced' : 'simple')))); render(); };
    const url = new URL(window.location.href); ['noi', 'capex', 'discount', 'reletting', 'mw'].forEach((name) => { const value = url.searchParams.get(`apld_${name}`); if (value !== null && Number.isFinite(Number(value))) input(name).value = value; }); advanced = url.searchParams.get('apldmode') === 'advanced';
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[type="range"]').forEach((node) => node.addEventListener('input', () => { root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-preset]').forEach((button) => { button.classList.remove('active'); button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false'); }); render(); }));
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-preset]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => setPreset(button.dataset.preset as keyof typeof presets))); root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.addEventListener('click', () => setPreset('base'));
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-tab]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => { advanced = button.dataset.tab === 'advanced'; root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-advanced]').forEach((node) => node.hidden = !advanced); root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-tab]').forEach((tab) => tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(tab === button))); render(); }));
    root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-share]')!.addEventListener('click', async () => { setUrl(); try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(window.location.href); const button = root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-share]')!; button.textContent = ko ? '복사됨' : 'Copied'; setTimeout(() => button.textContent = ko ? '설정 링크 복사' : 'Copy settings link', 1400); } catch {} });
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-advanced]').forEach((node) => node.hidden = !advanced); root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-tab]').forEach((button) => button.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(button.dataset.tab === (advanced ? 'advanced' : 'simple')))); render();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .apld-lab { --ink:#23304a; --muted:#687083; --line:#d9deea; --soft:#f1f3fa; --accent:#5368d7; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; margin:2rem 0; padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem); overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:22px; background:#f8f9fd; box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(31,44,77,.08); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--sans); }.apld-lab *, .apld-lab *::before, .apld-lab *::after { box-sizing:border-box; min-width:0; } header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; } header > div { min-width:0; } header h3 { margin:.2rem 0; font:700 clamp(1.35rem,3vw,2.1rem)/1.2 var(--serif); overflow-wrap:anywhere; } :global(html[lang="ko"]) header h3, :global(html[lang="ko"]) .reverse h4, :global(html[lang="ko"]) .section-heading h4 { font-family:var(--serif-kr),var(--serif); } header p:not(.kicker) { max-width:720px; margin:.4rem 0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.55; }.kicker,.section-heading span,.reverse > div > span { margin:0; color:#5368a2; font:700 .68rem/1.3 ui-monospace,monospace; letter-spacing:.12em; }.badge { height:max-content; padding:.35rem .65rem; flex:0 0 auto; border:1px solid #c9d0ed; border-radius:999px; color:#5368a2; font-size:.7rem; font-weight:700; white-space:nowrap; }.toolbar { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:.35rem; margin:1.2rem 0; }.toolbar > span { margin-right:.3rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:.72rem; font-weight:700; }.toolbar button,.mode-tabs button { min-height:36px; padding:.45rem .7rem; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; background:#fff; color:var(--ink); font:700 .78rem/1.2 var(--sans); cursor:pointer; }.toolbar button.active,.mode-tabs button[aria-selected="true"] { border-color:var(--ink); background:var(--ink); color:#fff; }.toolbar [data-reset] { margin-left:auto; }.results { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.65rem; }.results > div { display:flex; min-width:0; min-height:108px; padding:.8rem; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:13px; background:#fff; }.results .primary { background:var(--ink); color:#fff; }.results span,.results small { color:var(--muted); font-size:.7rem; line-height:1.35; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }.results .primary span,.results .primary small { color:#cbd2e2; }.results strong { margin:.2rem 0; font:700 clamp(1.3rem,3vw,1.9rem)/1 var(--serif); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }.reverse { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; align-items:center; gap:1rem; margin:1rem 0; padding:1rem; border-left:4px solid var(--accent); border-radius:0 12px 12px 0; background:#eceffd; }.reverse h4 { margin:.15rem 0; font:700 1rem/1.35 var(--serif); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }.reverse p { margin:0; color:var(--muted); font-size:.72rem; line-height:1.45; }.reverse > strong { font:700 clamp(1.2rem,4vw,1.75rem)/1 var(--serif); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; text-align:right; }.mode-tabs { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.4rem; margin:1.3rem 0 .7rem; }.workbench { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(240px,.7fr); gap:.8rem; }.controls,.bridge,.sensitivity { min-width:0; padding:1rem; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; background:#fff; }.section-heading { display:block; padding:0; border:0; color:inherit; font-size:inherit; letter-spacing:normal; text-transform:none; }.section-heading > span { display:block; }.section-heading h4 { margin:.15rem 0 1rem; font:700 1.05rem/1.35 var(--serif); }.control-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.85rem; }.control-grid + .control-grid { margin-top:.85rem; }.control-grid label { display:grid; min-width:0; gap:.45rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:.74rem; font-weight:700; }.control-grid label > span { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:.5rem; line-height:1.35; }.control-grid output { flex:0 0 auto; color:var(--ink); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; white-space:nowrap; }.control-grid input { display:block; width:100%; min-width:0; margin:0; accent-color:var(--accent); }.validation { margin:1rem 0 0; color:var(--muted); font-size:.7rem; line-height:1.55; }.bridge dl { display:grid; gap:.45rem; margin:0; }.bridge dl > div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:.6rem; padding:.55rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }.bridge dt { color:var(--muted); font-size:.72rem; line-height:1.35; }.bridge dd { margin:0; max-width:58%; flex:0 0 auto; font-weight:700; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; text-align:right; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }.bridge .total { padding:.7rem; border:0; border-radius:8px; background:var(--soft); }.bridge > p,.model-note { color:var(--muted); font-size:.7rem; line-height:1.55; }.sensitivity { margin-top:.8rem; }.sensitivity-bars { display:grid; gap:.65rem; }.sensitivity-bars :global(div) { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(76px,.8fr) minmax(0,2fr) 36px; align-items:center; gap:.6rem; }.sensitivity-bars :global(span),.sensitivity-bars :global(b) { font-size:.72rem; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }.sensitivity-bars :global(b) { text-align:right; }.sensitivity-bars :global(i) { display:block; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background:var(--soft); overflow:hidden; }.sensitivity-bars :global(i)::after { display:block; width:var(--w); height:100%; border-radius:inherit; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#91a0ed); content:""; }.model-note { margin:1rem 0 0; }.advanced-controls[hidden],[hidden] { display:none !important; } @media (max-width:800px) { header { display:block; }.badge { display:inline-block; margin-top:.6rem; }.results { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }.workbench { grid-template-columns:1fr; } } @media (max-width:520px) { .apld-lab { padding:1rem; border-radius:16px; }.toolbar > span { flex-basis:100%; }.toolbar [data-reset] { margin-left:0; }.control-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }.reverse { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:.65rem; }.reverse > strong { justify-self:start; text-align:left; } } @media (max-width:340px) { .results { grid-template-columns:1fr; } } :global(html.dark) .apld-lab { --ink:#edf0f7; --muted:#aab1c2; --line:#41485b; --soft:#282e3d; background:#1d222d; color:#edf0f7; }:global(html.dark) .results > div,:global(html.dark) .controls,:global(html.dark) .bridge,:global(html.dark) .sensitivity,:global(html.dark) .toolbar button,:global(html.dark) .mode-tabs button { background:#252b38; }:global(html.dark) .results .primary,:global(html.dark) .toolbar button.active,:global(html.dark) .mode-tabs button[aria-selected="true"] { background:#10151f; }:global(html.dark) .reverse { background:#292f49; }
</style>
